            <div class="image-card sqs-dynamic-text-container">

              
                <div class="image-title-wrapper"><div class="image-title sqs-dynamic-text"
                
  
><p class="">Meet Erika</p></div></div>
              

              
                <div class="image-subtitle-wrapper"><div class="image-subtitle sqs-dynamic-text"
                
  
><p class="">Erika Uyterhoeven is running for State Representative of the 27th Middlesex in Somerville to fight for a government that works for the many, not the few. As an organizer, an antitrust economist, a democratic socialist, and a proud daughter of a single mother, Erika understands both the struggles working people face and the mechanisms by which corporations take control of our government to rig the rules in their favor.</p><p class=""><a href="https://www.electerika.com/meeterika">Learn More</a></p></div></div>
              

              

            </div>
          </figcaption>
        

      </figure>

    

  


