        </div>
        
          
        
      </section>

    

  

    

      <section id="covid-19-somerville" class="Index-page"  data-collection-id="5e948a4b14b45c6b9bb99632" data-parallax-id="5e948a4b14b45c6b9bb99632" data-edit-main-image="Background">
        
        <div class="Index-page-content ">
          <div class="sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12" data-type="page" data-updated-on="1586875063092" id="page-5e948a4b14b45c6b9bb99632"><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-12 span-12"><div class="sqs-block horizontalrule-block sqs-block-horizontalrule" data-block-type="47" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1586793716669_5739"><div class="sqs-block-content"><hr /></div></div><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-dd9042fecdf563ff2f57"><div class="sqs-block-content"><h2 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>COVID-19</strong></h2><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="">As a strong, unique community, I believe that we can use this crisis to better ourselves and to demand the changes we need to strengthen our state and country. We must champion the health, safety, and welfare of all, not just the powerful and wealthy. The economic havoc of COVID has devastated so many working families and life as we know it has changed. </p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Coronavirus has forced us to change how we are campaigning but our mission remains just as critical in these difficult times. We need someone in the Massachusetts state house to fight for eviction freezes, healthcare for all, and pandemic response teams on the state and local level. </p><p style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;" class="">I promise that I will fight for all people to be treated with dignity and respect in this time of crisis.</p></div></div><div class="sqs-block button-block sqs-block-button" data-block-type="53" id="block-c786933d0e1075ae4433"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-block-button-container--center" data-animation-role="button" data-alignment="center" data-button-size="small">
	<a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1V8R4LTBBO0tbvPnsK9ZkTXUK2Vkp8yR5497NtELCNhQ/edit?usp=sharing" class="sqs-block-button-element--small sqs-block-button-element" >Read More</a>
</div>
</div></div><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1586810052805_18655"><div class="sqs-block-content"><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Our campaign office may not be open but we are still mobilizing to help our community during this difficult time and we need your support. Sign up in the volunteer form below to be a remote volunteer. You can phone bank and text from the comfort of your home.</p></div></div><div class="sqs-block form-block sqs-block-form" data-block-type="9" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1586810052805_15600"><div class="sqs-block-content">





<div class="form-wrapper"
  
>
  
