      <section id="erikas-platform" class="Index-page Index-page--has-image"  data-parallax-original-element data-collection-id="5e7fa69963d7965a888d2ec5" data-parallax-id="5e7fa69963d7965a888d2ec5" data-edit-main-image="Background">
        
        <div class="Index-page-content  sqs-alternate-block-style-container">
          <div class="sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12" data-type="page" data-updated-on="1586793099710" id="page-5e7fa69963d7965a888d2ec5"><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-12 span-12"><div class="sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1" data-block-type="21" id="block-21ac61f86205c32994bb"><div class="sqs-block-content">&nbsp;</div></div><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-4 span-4"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-b1e14de5cf1d5ebfff31"><div class="sqs-block-content"><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Erika’s Platform</h2></div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-8 span-8"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-797b28d4a2dda0dc5e5d"><div class="sqs-block-content"><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">My commitment to justice comes from my background. I was raised by my single mom who immigrated from Japan. We were lucky - my mom had a good paying union job, which enabled us to live with dignity.  My experience a co-founder of act on mass, the lead organization fighting for transparency and accountability on beacon hill, and as an antitrust economist has prepared me to fight for working people. </p></div></div><div class="sqs-block button-block sqs-block-button" data-block-type="53" id="block-d57e1839550ec80f4fcb"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-block-button-container--left" data-animation-role="button" data-alignment="left" data-button-size="large">
	<a href="/issues" class="sqs-block-button-element--large sqs-block-button-element" >Learn More</a>
</div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1" data-block-type="21" id="block-a565f78fdb235bebe7ec"><div class="sqs-block-content">&nbsp;</div></div><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-6 span-6"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-17f487fc9e900eb0317b"><div class="sqs-block-content"><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Housing</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Every Resident deserves stable housing as a human right. Erika will work to ensure tenant’s rights are protected with just cause eviction, freedom from unjust fees, and tenants right to purchase. The displacement of working and middle class residents must stop and the ban on rent control should be lifted. <br>&nbsp;</p><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">A Green new deal</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Our children deserve a livable future and a healthy planet. We must commit ourselves to 100% renewable energy by 2030. The MBTA must become fully funded, sustainable, and free. Communities most impacted by climate change must lead the transition to a green economy.</p></div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-6 span-6"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-773c843d016d631fa119"><div class="sqs-block-content"><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Public Education</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Every young person deserves and excellent education. All schools must be fully funded regardless of zip code. Every family should have access to high quality pre-k education. All students of public universities should graduate debt free. <br>&nbsp;</p><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">immigration</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">No resident should live in fear, regardless of immigration status. Our communities must be kept safe from intrusive police practices and Trump’s immigration policies by passing the Safe Communities Act. The Work and Family Mobility Act should also be enacted to guarantee everyone can get a driver’s licence, regardless of status.  </p></div></div></div></div><div class="sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1" data-block-type="21" id="block-1ddc3add65986cdd8924"><div class="sqs-block-content">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div>
        </div>
        
          
            <figure class="Index-page-image" data-parallax-image-wrapper>
              
  <img data-src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5e29d23051bb0c3dff5a0808/1585425841019-XX4ZMCH8ZUGORFSEQ45U/ke17ZwdGBToddI8pDm48kBZw6jF4_OvU-ddo_vwqGhp7gQa3H78H3Y0txjaiv_0fDoOvxcdMmMKkDsyUqMSsMWxHk725yiiHCCLfrh8O1z5QPOohDIaIeljMHgDF5CVlOqpeNLcJ80NK65_fV7S1UdkFEsTPAlZXfxmj7cmUh6QA629hmdzxozp9me9n7i4U3WUfc_ZsVm9Mi1E6FasEnQ/52bda0-2048x1536.png" data-image="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5e29d23051bb0c3dff5a0808/1585425841019-XX4ZMCH8ZUGORFSEQ45U/ke17ZwdGBToddI8pDm48kBZw6jF4_OvU-ddo_vwqGhp7gQa3H78H3Y0txjaiv_0fDoOvxcdMmMKkDsyUqMSsMWxHk725yiiHCCLfrh8O1z5QPOohDIaIeljMHgDF5CVlOqpeNLcJ80NK65_fV7S1UdkFEsTPAlZXfxmj7cmUh6QA629hmdzxozp9me9n7i4U3WUfc_ZsVm9Mi1E6FasEnQ/52bda0-2048x1536.png" data-image-dimensions="2048x1536" data-image-focal-point="0.5,0.5" alt="52bda0-2048x1536.png"  data-load="false" />

            </figure>
          
        
      </section>

    

  

    

      <section id="get-involved" class="Index-page"  data-collection-id="5e7faddce1a6fc55dd6a605e" data-parallax-id="5e7faddce1a6fc55dd6a605e" data-edit-main-image="Background">
        
        <div class="Index-page-content ">
          <div class="sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12" data-type="page" data-updated-on="1586810102251" id="page-5e7faddce1a6fc55dd6a605e"><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-12 span-12"><div class="sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1" data-block-type="21" id="block-e7b2bc5076163d4ad82e"><div class="sqs-block-content">&nbsp;</div></div><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-4 span-4"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-7b32c3331dc7cd1a4828"><div class="sqs-block-content"><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Get Involved</h2></div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-8 span-8"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-c7385f578f9afd7a8d5d"><div class="sqs-block-content"><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Engaging voters requires good volunteers!&nbsp;We need people who can dedicate months or minutes to the campaign.&nbsp;  </p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">No commitment of time is too small!</p></div></div></div></div><div class="sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1" data-block-type="21" id="block-600e9605d202f443de0f"><div class="sqs-block-content">&nbsp;</div></div><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-4 span-4"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-9ef1394f2f73d4bbb66e"><div class="sqs-block-content"><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Sign Up For an event</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>We’re building our team in neighborhoods all over Somerville. We’re organizing grassroots to win.</em></p></div></div><div class="sqs-block button-block sqs-block-button" data-block-type="53" id="block-52d7019164f75ef41e93"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-block-button-container--left" data-animation-role="button" data-alignment="left" data-button-size="small">
	<a href="https://www.electerika.com/events" class="sqs-block-button-element--small sqs-block-button-element" >Events</a>
</div>
</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-8 span-8"><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-4 span-4"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-e2dd08e910f778a7fe7c"><div class="sqs-block-content"><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Volunteer opportunities</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>Volunteers with the campaign participate in ways big and small, but together we are a movement for change.</em></p></div></div><div class="sqs-block button-block sqs-block-button" data-block-type="53" id="block-01011ea38982fa0946d3"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-block-button-container--left" data-animation-role="button" data-alignment="left" data-button-size="small">
	<a href="https://www.electerika.com/volunteer-2" class="sqs-block-button-element--small sqs-block-button-element" >Learn More</a>
</div>
</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-4 span-4"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" id="block-dd36659beaddb9926e64"><div class="sqs-block-content"><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Make a Donation</h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>Your financial support enables us to share our message of progressive values and grow the movement.</em></p></div></div><div class="sqs-block button-block sqs-block-button" data-block-type="53" id="block-ba391273160843306081"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-block-button-container--left" data-animation-role="button" data-alignment="left" data-button-size="small">
	<a href="https://secure.actblue.com/donate/committee-to-elect-erika-uyterhoeven-1" class="sqs-block-button-element--small sqs-block-button-element" >Donate</a>
</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1" data-block-type="21" id="block-6116af43e04acda1a1fa"><div class="sqs-block-content">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div>
        </div>
        
          
        
      </section>

    

  

    

